  "content": "\n\n<div><h1>FPS 叠加层</h1><h3>简单 &amp; 轻量性能监控器</h3><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffps-overlay\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/fps-overlay?style=for-the-badge&color=00AF5C&label=Modrinth\" alt=\"Modrinth 下载量\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/projects/1341801\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/1341801?style=for-the-badge&color=D15B40&label=CurseForge\" alt=\"CurseForge 下载量\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffps-overlay%252fversions\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/v/fps-overlay?style=for-the-badge&color=orange&label=Latest Ver\" alt=\"版本\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/hihcam/fps-overlay-Fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/GitHub-Source_Code-6e5494?style=for-the-badge&logo=github\" alt=\"GitHub 源代码\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/hihcam/fps-overlay-Fabric/blob/main/LICENSE\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/license/hihcam/fps-overlay-Fabric?style=for-the-badge&logo=github&color=blue&cacheSeconds=1\" alt=\"许可证\"></a></div>\n<hr>\n<div><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/tlJUHTnhtV8\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>曾在 AsianHalfSquat 的视频中亮相！v3.6 <strong>旧版</strong></h2>\n<p>曾出现在 <strong>\"Voxy vs Distant Horizons\"</strong> 展示中。使用内置预设即可拥有同样的专业美学风格！</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/98cefb6ba826b3c2472c30824371712a9793e8b7.jpeg\" alt=\"AsianHalfSquat 特色展示\"></p>\n<hr>\n<h2>功能特点</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>实时数据：</strong>即时追踪 FPS、平均 FPS、延迟和内存使用情况。</li>\n<li><strong>完全可自定义：</strong>通过配置菜单轻松更改<strong>大小、位置和颜色</strong>。</li>\n<li><strong>快速切换：</strong>按一次键即可隐藏或显示叠加层。<strong>（默认：<code>o</code>）</strong></li>\n<li><strong>极致轻量：</strong>为性能而优化编写，不会影响你的帧率。</li>\n<li><strong>跨平台支持：</strong>全面支持 <strong>Fabric</strong>、<strong>NeoForge</strong> 和 <strong>Forge</strong>。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2>安装 &amp; 设置</h2>\n<h3>如何安装</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>下载并安装你喜欢的加载器（<strong>Fabric</strong> 或 <strong>NeoForge</strong>）。</li>\n<li>下载对应 Minecraft 版本的 <strong>FPS Overlay</strong> jar 文件。</li>\n<li>将其放入 <code>.minecraft/mods</code> 文件夹。</li>\n<li>启动游戏，尽情体验！</li>\n</ol>\n<h3>如何切换模式</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>打开配置菜单（在 Fabric 上使用 <strong>Mod Menu</strong>）。</li>\n<li>找到 <strong>布局类型</strong> 设置。</li>\n<li>在 <strong>默认</strong>、<strong>导航栏</strong> 或 <strong>AsianHalfSquat</strong> 风格之间切换。</li>\n</ol>",
